t input. Strictly it's a separate node, but the essay treats partial similarity as an imperfect predictor with a noise parent, so I'm looking at how the accuracy term would be set.\n\nI'm checking the threshold: passing pays off only if the other copy's output matches mine with accuracy above 5/7, roughly 0.714. Given the same model and essay with only names and lead text differing, I think that correlation is high, so I'm leaning toward passing, while still noting that a strict reading would make defecting dominant.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy's decision node counts as the same node under A-FDT, given it runs the same function on a different input. Strictly it's a separate node, but the essay treats partial similarity as an imperfect predictor with a noise parent, so I'm looking at how the accuracy term would be set.\n\nI'm checking the threshold: passing pays off only if the other copy's output matches mine with accuracy above 5/7, roughly 0.714. Given the same model and essay with only names and lead text differing, I think that correlation is high, so I'm leaning toward passing, while still noting that a strict reading would make defecting dominant.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8516,"completion_tokens":962,"total_tokens":9478,"cost":0.053304,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.053304,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.034064,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01924},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":433,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}